From: Saphira packaging <recipes@saphira.vm2.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] Makefile: resolve install via PATH, not /usr/bin

Saphira is non-usrmerged and coreutils is --bindir=/bin, so there is
no /usr/bin/install; a hardcoded absolute path fails the install
phase with Error 127. Plain `install` resolves through PATH to
/bin/install, like every other recipe's install step.

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -158,1 +158,1 @@
-INSTALL = /usr/bin/install
+INSTALL = install
